# Raw incident-investigation exports behind the first-party case studies. These
# workbooks hold unredacted production data — masked card numbers, customer IPs,
# 3DS tokens, session/transaction keys, internal hostnames — and even their
# filenames carry internal ticket numbers. This repo is public and Pages serves
# from it, so they must never be committed; only the anonymised article is.
docs/case-study-drafts/
